      "note": "coq-graph-theory 0.9.7 provides induced (sgraph.v), diso and its notation (digraph.v), isubgraph and diso_Kn, but no induced-free class predicate. GTBase.common.induced_free (host first, pattern second) is the canonical, already used directly by X211, X223 and X226. The ten local copies negate inhabited (induced S ≃ H) while induced_free negates diso directly, so they are logically equivalent (GTBase.common.induced_free_inhabited), not convertible. Minor.foundations.containment.has_induced_copy, inhabited (H ⇀ G), is the positive form (related through isubgraph_induced) and stays outside this family.",
